# Testing and Validation

- Prefer deterministic tests; mock unstable platform/network dependencies.
- Cover core logic branches and failure states for reducers, helpers, and services.
- Keep assertions behavior-focused rather than implementation-detail-focused.

## For feature work

- Add or update tests when changing business logic.
- If tests are not added, explain why and provide a manual validation checklist.
- Run targeted tests first, then broader `npm test` when feasible.
